we are building a mechanic booking platform "SPANR" where multiple companies and mechanics can enroll and users can book them for service, repairs,etc.
this project has two folders
 - spanr_app -> flutter app for users to book mechanic
 - spanr-mechanic -> react app for mechanic dashboard

**Module File Structure Convention**
Maintain the following structure for each module:

```
spanr_app/
  sql/
    module.sql                       // SQL scripts related to the module

spanr-mechanic/
  src/
    module/
      module.service.ts              // Business logic and service functions
      module.type.ts                 // TypeScript types and interfaces
      module.hook.ts                 // Custom React hooks
      module_component.service.tsx  // UI-related services or components
    pages/
      module.tsx                     // Page-level component or entry point

  sql/
    module.sql                       // SQL scripts related to the module
```

> ✅ **Always follow this file structure when creating or updating modules.**

